---
import founderImage from "/public/images/About-us.jpg";
---

<section class="bg-white py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">

    <!-- Top Section -->
    <div class="grid items-start gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2">

      <!-- Left Image -->
      <div class="relative">
        <img
          src={founderImage.src}
          alt="Mr. B.K. Kiran"
          class="h-[420px] w-full rounded-[28px] object-cover shadow-lg"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Right Content -->
      <div>

        <span
          class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-[#D63232]">
          About Us
        </span>

        <h2
          class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-[#16233D]">
          Building Trust Through
          <span class="text-[#D63232]"> Quality & Commitment</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-lg leading-9 text-gray-700">

          <p>
            Udbhav Developers is a founder-led boutique real estate firm
            specializing in premium residential and commercial developments
            in prime locations. Guided by engineering discipline,
            transparent practices, and a long-term value mindset, the company
            delivers thoughtfully crafted spaces that balance design
            excellence, structural integrity, and enduring investment
            confidence.
          </p>

          <div class="border-l-4 border-[#D63232] pl-6">
            <p>
              Led by <strong>Mr. B.K. Kiran</strong>, a qualified civil engineer
              with over two decades of international and domestic experience,
              Udbhav Developers follows a focused, quality-first approach,
              creating developments that perform today and remain relevant for
              generations.
            </p>

            <p class="mt-4">
              His professional exposure spans India, the UAE, Oman,
              and the UK, giving him a strong global perspective supported
              by deep technical expertise and practical execution skills.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Content -->

    <div class="mt-16 space-y-8 text-lg leading-9 text-gray-700">

      <p>
        Mr. Kiran remains closely involved in every stage of development,
        from land evaluation and feasibility studies to design coordination,
        construction supervision, and final delivery. His engineering
        background ensures disciplined planning, cost control, structural
        integrity, and adherence to timelines. This hands-on leadership model
        allows the company to maintain high standards and direct accountability
        across every project.
      </p>

      <p>
        Rather than pursuing aggressive expansion, Udbhav Developers has
        adopted a focused growth strategy. By limiting the number of projects
        undertaken at any given time, the firm ensures that every development
        receives full attention, resulting in superior design resolution,
        consistent quality, and dependable delivery.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>